ived him out of their sight.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Romans 3:18","note":"“There is no fear of God before their eyes.”","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Corinthians 2:9","note":"But as it is written, “Things which an eye didn’t see, and an ear didn’t hear, which didn’t enter into the heart of man, these God has prepared for those who…","source":"web"},{"ref":"Galatians 3:1","note":"Foolish Galatians, who has bewitched you not to obey the truth, before whose eyes Jesus Christ was openly portrayed among you as crucified?","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}